# r1 walks and turns, r2 follows it, r3 follows r2..., for 60 s
ForceSuccess
  Timeout 600
    Parallel
      Repeat
        Sequence
          Move r1 forward=1.5
          Move r1 turn=30deg
      Follow r2 r1 distance=1.2
      Follow r3 r2 distance=1.2
      Follow r4 r3 distance=1.2
      Follow r5 r4 distance=1.2
      Follow r6 r5 distance=1.2
      Follow r7 r6 distance=1.2

